chx:X_LoginAfterTls a owl:NamedIndividual, chx:LoginAfterTls ; rdfs:label "smtp.login(user, password)"@en ; skos:definition "login before STARTTLS raised SMTPNotSupportedError (SMTP AUTH extension not supported by server) because the server offered AUTH only after TLS; after STARTTLS login returned (235, b'2.7.0 Authentication successful') and a wrong password raised SMTPAuthenticationError with code 535."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch20/research> .
