chx:CQs a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestionSet ; rdfs:label "Chapter 20 competency questions"@en ; rd:containsCompetencyQuestion chx:CQ1, chx:CQ2 .
chx:CQ1 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which parts of a program that sends or reads email, sends a text or pushes a notification can be shown to work, and which can only be shown to fail, on a machine that has no Gmail account, no phone number and no push service?"@en .
chx:CQ2 a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:CompetencyQuestion ; rdfs:label "Which printed outputs, programs, numbers and statements of the chapter differ in current releases of Python and of the packages it uses, in the zone of the reader, in the services it names or in the files and pages it points to, and on what source?"@en .
chx:Provenance a owl:NamedIndividual, rd:ResearchSubjectInput ; rdfs:label "Derived from the chapter 20 research artefact"@en ;
    skos:definition "Concepts are corpus-derived from the 3rd edition's chapter 20 through the Stage 1 research artefact; the modern-practice branch comes from that artefact's secondary sources."@en ;
    dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0414/ch20/research> .
